Notes / troubleshooting
selector does not match template labels error — the spec.selector.matchLabels and spec.template.metadata.labels must be identical (the template labels are a superset of the selector matchLabels). Fix the mismatch and re-apply.

apiVersion error — ReplicaSets are apps/v1, not v1. Using v1 results in no matches for kind "ReplicaSet".

Pods Pending — usually insufficient cluster resources. Check with kubectl describe pod <pod-name> and kubectl get events.

ImagePullBackOff — node can't pull nginx:latest; check network/registry access with kubectl describe pod <pod-name>.

Adjusting replicas later — kubectl scale replicaset nginx-replicaset-t3q5 --replicas=<N>, or kubectl edit rs nginx-replicaset-t3q5.

ReplicaSet vs Deployment — ReplicaSets don't support rolling updates natively (you'd change the template and old pods get replaced all at once). For production apps, a Deployment (which manages a ReplicaSet) is generally preferred. Here, a plain ReplicaSet was explicitly requested.

